# 📦 Packaging Domain SQL Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing packaging industry data using SQL.

The company manufactures:

* Boxes
* Bottles
* Wrappers

The objective of this project is to generate business insights related to:

* Production efficiency
* Defect analysis
* Revenue tracking
* Profitability analysis
* Inventory monitoring

