# 📌 SQL Analysis Tasks

## ✅ Task 1: Defect Rate per Product

Calculated:

```text
defect_rate = defective_quantity / quantity_produced
```

Insights:

* Total production
* Total defective units
* Product wise defect rate

---

## ✅ Task 2: Top Performing Product by Revenue

Calculated:

```text
revenue = quantity_sold × selling_price_per_unit
```

Insights:

* Highest revenue generating product

---

## ✅ Task 3: Monthly Production Trend

Insights:

* Monthly production totals
* Production growth tracking

---

## ✅ Task 4: Category Wise Profit

Calculated:

```text
profit = selling_price - cost_price
```

Insights:

* Revenue by category
* Cost by category
* Profit by category

---

## ✅ Task 5: High Defect Days

Condition:

```text
defect_rate > 5%
```

Insights:

* Poor production quality days
* Product defect analysis

---

## ✅ Task 6: Running Total Revenue

Insights:

* Cumulative revenue tracking
* Revenue growth over time

---

## ✅ Task 7: Best Category by Profit Margin

Calculated:

```text
profit_margin = profit / revenue
```

Insights:

* Most profitable category

---

## ✅ Task 8: Unsold Inventory

Condition:

```text
produced > sold
```

Insights:

* Inventory remaining
* Overstock analysis

